From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:57:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] no_std: use the prebuilt std for musl_arm64

Use the prebuilt std for the arm64 host; it needs the matching proc_macro from the same sysroot.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 no_std/Android.bp | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/no_std/Android.bp b/no_std/Android.bp
index 37b92cf..1b4422e 100644
--- a/no_std/Android.bp
+++ b/no_std/Android.bp
@@ -31,8 +31,10 @@ cc_defaults {
             ],
         },
         musl_arm64: {
+            // Native arm64 build host: the prebuilt std (with its matching
+            // proc_macro) is used, like on the other build hosts.
             whole_static_libs: [
-                "libstd",
+                "prebuilt_libstd",
             ],
         },
         darwin_arm64: {
